From 0659af7263345176c4ec9cfde3f70bc7eb178342 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jacky Chou <jacky_chou@aspeedtech.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 14:48:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] cmd: aspeed: nettest: add multicast filter test

Add a netdiag multicast filter mode that programs the MAC hash table
and verifies whether multicast packets are received or dropped for each
bucket. The new scan and random modes exercise the MAHT registers
through the existing nettest transmit and receive path.

Signed-off-by: Jacky Chou <jacky_chou@aspeedtech.com>
Change-Id: I521345e519365ececbc02ebd55302ad058186ed5
Upstream-Status: Backport [SDK v11.03 migration]
